Let's get it, Fuse.

286
00:23:37,334 --> 00:23:38,134
Here.

287
00:23:40,320 --> 00:23:41,254
I accidently bought extra.

288
00:23:41,834 --> 00:23:42,701
So here you go.

289
00:23:43,926 --> 00:23:45,026
It's an extra one.

290
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:52,800
Thanks.

291
00:23:55,700 --> 00:23:56,500
You can drink it.

292
00:24:21,667 --> 00:24:23,334
Why don't you sit with your friends?

293
00:24:29,154 --> 00:24:30,620
I want to sit here.

294
00:24:36,507 --> 00:24:37,807
Can I sit here?

295
00:25:30,610 --> 00:25:31,865
Hey.

296
00:25:34,570 --> 00:25:36,525
You killed it.

297
00:25:36,526 --> 00:25:37,342
Nailed it.

298
00:25:39,479 --> 00:25:41,479
I should probably ask for
your autrograph in advance.

299
00:25:44,269 --> 00:25:45,436
Me too. Me too.

300
00:25:47,523 --> 00:25:49,757
Our school drum majors are really cool today.

301
00:25:49,782 --> 00:25:50,631
Yeah.

302
00:25:50,656 --> 00:25:53,107
By the way, where is Rodtang?

303
00:25:53,836 --> 00:25:55,836
Right, he told me he's going to a bathroom.

304
00:25:55,861 --> 00:25:56,661
Ah.

305
00:25:58,096 --> 00:26:01,053
Fuse, I took so many pictures of you.

306
00:26:01,078 --> 00:26:01,920
Turn on your AirDrop.

307
00:26:02,436 --> 00:26:02,967
Really?

308
00:26:02,992 --> 00:26:03,492
Um.

309
00:26:05,931 --> 00:26:07,438
I don't have my phone with me right now.

310
00:26:07,463 --> 00:26:07,843
What?

311
00:26:07,868 --> 00:26:08,368
What?

312
00:26:08,600 --> 00:26:09,661
Where did you leave it?

313
00:26:09,887 --> 00:26:10,687
I don't know.

314
00:26:11,894 --> 00:26:13,261
It's fine.

315
00:26:13,261 --> 00:26:14,094
I guess I might be lost by now.

316
00:26:14,228 --> 00:26:15,028
I'll send them to you later then.

317
00:26:17,894 --> 00:26:19,294
Well, where is Tee?

318
00:26:37,461 --> 00:26:39,661
Hey, that's Tee.

319
00:26:48,867 --> 00:26:50,267
Are you a basketball player?

320
00:26:51,961 --> 00:26:53,161
A substitute.

321
00:26:53,887 --> 00:26:55,253
I'm probably play in the second half.

322
00:26:56,527 --> 00:26:57,461
By coming to this room...

323
00:26:58,047 --> 00:26:59,247
Are you looking for something in here?

324
00:27:03,720 --> 00:27:05,054
I'm here to get some encouragement.

325
00:27:06,574 --> 00:27:09,774
Well, go get them. I'm screaming for you.

326
00:27:11,540 --> 00:27:13,240
Hey, not you.

327
00:27:13,414 --> 00:27:15,575
It's him. Sit down.

328
00:27:15,600 --> 00:27:17,063
Sit down.

329
00:27:21,461 --> 00:27:22,861
Can I have some encouragement?

330
00:27:37,928 --> 00:27:39,077
Oh, what is this?

331
00:27:39,077 --> 00:27:40,928
I just dropped my thing. Can you pick it up for me?

332
00:27:41,994 --> 00:27:43,128
You got this.

333
00:27:49,661 --> 00:27:53,928
I wish you a victory and stay safe.

334
00:28:03,894 --> 00:28:04,694
I'm rooting for you.

335
00:28:13,661 --> 00:28:14,828
I feel encouraged now.

336
00:28:29,394 --> 00:28:30,261
I have to go.

337
00:28:31,261 --> 00:28:32,061
Um.

338
00:28:45,228 --> 00:28:46,430
You got this.

339
00:28:46,430 --> 00:28:48,294
Wish you stay safe, baby.

340
00:28:59,740 --> 00:29:00,841
I...

341
00:29:02,215 --> 00:29:09,051
I officially declare the 2026 annual
friendly basketball match to start now.

342
00:29:55,940 --> 00:29:57,173
Why don't you belive me?

343
00:29:59,073 --> 00:30:00,440
That you like me?

344
00:30:02,594 --> 00:30:04,494
I'm telling the truth. I'm swear to my life.

345
00:30:06,184 --> 00:30:09,364
Your oath means nothing.
You were messing with me few days ago.

346
00:30:09,642 --> 00:30:10,691
Then you're telling me that you like me now?

347
00:30:11,780 --> 00:30:12,888
Isn't it too fast?

348
00:30:14,067 --> 00:30:15,033
Why does it have to be slow?

349
00:30:17,981 --> 00:30:19,714
I've already thought about it.

350
00:30:21,661 --> 00:30:24,876
I've liked you since the day you helped me.

351
00:30:25,740 --> 00:30:27,274
What would you do if I weren't here?

352
00:30:29,447 --> 00:30:31,123
I'm sorry.

353
00:30:32,796 --> 00:30:35,329
On that day, you were hurt because of me.

354
00:30:36,289 --> 00:30:38,115
But you didn't say a word to blame me.

355
00:30:39,549 --> 00:30:41,580
You even allowed me to sleep at your place.

356
00:30:43,281 --> 00:30:44,081
You know what?

357
00:30:45,413 --> 00:30:47,147
When you were playing with Locky,

358
00:30:47,421 --> 00:30:48,721
you're freaking cute.

359
00:30:59,394 --> 00:31:00,560
It made me want to be a dog.

360
00:31:07,914 --> 00:31:09,414
Just so you might like me.

361
00:31:11,448 --> 00:31:13,014
Because I really like you.

362
00:31:16,148 --> 00:31:17,281
Are you crazy?

363
00:31:17,814 --> 00:31:18,914
You want to be a dog?

364
00:31:19,407 --> 00:31:21,574
I actually don't want to be a dog.

365
00:31:22,748 --> 00:31:24,348
I want to be your happiness.

366
00:31:28,548 --> 00:31:29,714
You're smiling.

367
00:31:31,714 --> 00:31:33,114
That means you're happy, right?

368
00:31:33,461 --> 00:31:34,261
That's nonsense.

369
00:31:36,080 --> 00:31:39,612
If you're not ready for a relationship,

370
00:31:39,812 --> 00:31:41,543
we can just be in a talking stage for now.

371
00:31:42,503 --> 00:31:44,599
Just give me a chance.

372
00:31:45,148 --> 00:31:47,881
I don't do the talking stage.

373
00:31:52,348 --> 00:31:53,614
Let's just date.

374
00:31:56,314 --> 00:31:57,614
If it doesn't work out, we can break up.

375
00:31:58,148 --> 00:31:59,014
Deal?

376
00:31:59,313 --> 00:32:00,113
Really?

377
00:32:01,107 --> 00:32:02,441
But I can't guarantee it.

378
00:32:03,108 --> 00:32:04,908
You might break up with me tomorrow.

379
00:32:07,914 --> 00:32:09,081
I'm serious.

380
00:32:09,960 --> 00:32:11,693
-Um.
-We won't break up.

381
00:32:13,248 --> 00:32:14,481
Let's just make it through tomorrow.

382
00:32:15,040 --> 00:32:16,340
Nai.

383
00:32:16,767 --> 00:32:18,301
Hey, someone might see us.

384
00:32:27,314 --> 00:32:28,114
My happiness.

385
00:32:33,510 --> 00:32:34,563
Let's go.

386
00:32:51,014 --> 00:32:52,348
It has to be NaiRodtang.

387
00:33:05,483 --> 00:33:06,593
Hello.

388
00:33:07,356 --> 00:33:10,919
I have a question. If I were a superhero,

389
00:33:11,013 --> 00:33:12,349
which superhero would I be?

390
00:33:14,683 --> 00:33:15,554
Superman?

391
00:33:15,554 --> 00:33:16,183
Nope.

392
00:33:17,516 --> 00:33:18,316
Batman?

393
00:33:18,683 --> 00:33:19,483
Nope.

394
00:33:20,169 --> 00:33:21,002
Spider-Man?

395
00:33:21,169 --> 00:33:21,969
Nope.

396
00:33:22,816 --> 00:33:23,849
The answer is...

397
00:33:24,322 --> 00:33:26,189
Your-Man!

398
00:33:29,595 --> 00:33:32,335
Isn't it funny?

399
00:33:34,762 --> 00:33:37,683
Here, have some water to cool down.

400
00:33:38,449 --> 00:33:41,683
I'm good. Is he crazy?

401
00:33:45,030 --> 00:33:46,697
Fine, I'll drink it by myself.

402
00:34:00,283 --> 00:34:00,867
What?

403
00:34:00,867 --> 00:34:01,549
Over there!

404
00:34:34,916 --> 00:34:36,960
Thank you for helping me.

405
00:34:37,106 --> 00:34:38,395
I don't know what I would've done without you.

406
00:34:39,716 --> 00:34:40,977
Don't mention it.

407
00:34:41,596 --> 00:34:43,402
I'm also struggling with it.

408
00:34:45,549 --> 00:34:48,583
By the way, are we friends now?

409
00:35:04,983 --> 00:35:07,349
Is it you who keep liking my posts?

410
00:35:13,183 --> 00:35:15,683
We're friends now. I gotta go.

411
00:35:57,549 --> 00:35:58,349
You got this, Tee.

412
00:35:58,916 --> 00:35:59,716
You got this.

413
00:35:59,983 --> 00:36:00,983
Go get them, Tee.

414
00:36:01,349 --> 00:36:02,149
Go get them.

415
00:36:42,674 --> 00:36:43,574
Hey, Sys.

416
00:36:44,108 --> 00:36:46,074
Hey, you're so cool in this morning.

417
00:36:46,107 --> 00:36:47,407
(Sys)
I already tagged you in the photo.

418
00:36:48,434 --> 00:36:49,234
Really?

419
00:36:51,168 --> 00:36:53,301
I'll check it later.

420
00:36:54,434 --> 00:36:55,367
Hey, look.

421
00:36:55,414 --> 00:36:57,508
Tee is pretty handsome.

422
00:37:01,851 --> 00:37:03,561
Yeah, he is.

423
00:37:04,976 --> 00:37:06,410
But he's a bit show-off.

424
00:37:11,714 --> 00:37:13,781
Do you know if he's seeing someone?

425
00:37:17,781 --> 00:37:18,648
Are you asking me?

426
00:37:20,581 --> 00:37:22,414
You seems pretty close to him.

427
00:37:25,714 --> 00:37:26,648
I don't know.

428
00:37:27,114 --> 00:37:28,114
Why did you ask?

429
00:37:28,448 --> 00:37:29,248
Fuse!

430
00:37:30,514 --> 00:37:31,681
Rodtang!

431
00:37:32,014 --> 00:37:32,914
I've been looking for you.

432
00:37:32,981 --> 00:37:34,114
I thought you had already gone home.

433
00:37:35,114 --> 00:37:36,181
You're busy doing...

434
00:37:39,781 --> 00:37:40,714
Nothing.

435
00:37:41,480 --> 00:37:44,746
Right, I've met your girlfriend
in front of the gymnasium.

436
00:37:45,748 --> 00:37:46,548
Huh?

437
00:37:52,468 --> 00:37:53,615
Gosh.

438
00:37:54,914 --> 00:37:55,748
I have to go.

439
00:37:58,899 --> 00:38:00,899
Block him.

440
00:38:01,264 --> 00:38:02,757
Yeah, keep going.

441
00:38:02,757 --> 00:38:05,420
Go, go.

442
00:39:45,214 --> 00:39:46,114
What's wrong?

443
00:39:58,914 --> 00:39:59,714
Don't follow me.

444
00:40:20,581 --> 00:40:23,389
Hey, where are you now?

445
00:40:23,389 --> 00:40:26,314
I'm in front of the building.

446
00:40:27,981 --> 00:40:28,948
Have you been waiting for a while?

447
00:40:29,781 --> 00:40:30,581
Not at all.

448
00:40:31,181 --> 00:40:32,114
I've just arrived.

449
00:40:32,581 --> 00:40:34,414
What about you?

450
00:40:34,748 --> 00:40:35,548
I've arrived for a while.

451
00:40:36,248 --> 00:40:37,314
It's been a while.

452
00:40:45,981 --> 00:40:47,548
Shall we get inside?

453
00:40:50,987 --> 00:40:51,787
Jeen.

454
00:40:54,048 --> 00:40:54,848
Fuse.

455
00:40:58,514 --> 00:40:59,448
What a coincidence.

456
00:41:12,314 --> 00:41:14,248
It's Lakers team, damn.

457
00:41:15,414 --> 00:41:16,748
It's not... it's not that intense.

458
00:41:17,014 --> 00:41:18,164
Not intense.

459
00:41:18,164 --> 00:41:20,048
It's easy like playing for fun.

460
00:41:21,214 --> 00:41:22,600
Maybe...

461
00:41:23,782 --> 00:41:25,790
You haven't met him before, have you?

462
00:41:35,181 --> 00:41:36,814
This is mine. Yours is...

463
00:41:37,114 --> 00:41:37,914
This one.

464
00:41:38,781 --> 00:41:39,914
Try it.

465
00:41:40,248 --> 00:41:41,314
Shall we buy neckties?

466
00:41:48,381 --> 00:41:51,881
That's Tea, my brother.

467
00:42:27,887 --> 00:42:30,258
What's going on between Fuse and you?

468
00:42:30,820 --> 00:42:32,716
That's not how friends treat each other.

469
00:42:33,114 --> 00:42:35,981
Aren't you happy Jeen doesn't have anyone else?

470
00:42:36,547 --> 00:42:39,133
You can't control...

471
00:42:39,158 --> 00:42:41,584
who you fall in love with or when it happens.

472
00:42:42,043 --> 00:42:43,076
It's more about...

473
00:42:43,774 --> 00:42:45,619
how you handle it.

474
00:42:46,534 --> 00:42:49,050
I think we should take a break.

475
00:42:49,732 --> 00:42:51,140
I need some time to think.
